      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 The Society of Thoracic Surgeons. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We present a case of a 39-year-old woman with scimitar syndrome who had a 2-patch repair 3 decades previously and presented with a right-to-left shunt of the inferior vena cava (IVC) to the left atrium resulting from baffle dehiscence. We discuss details of our reoperative repair."
      },
